{"id":"961683c3b48a18ae","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-term.md","title":"项的有限阶段构造","display":"df-term — 项的有限阶段构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-term","aliases":["43-df-term"],"display":"df-term — 项的有限阶段构造","depends_on":["[[43-df-variable]]","[[43-df-first-order-language]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term — 项的有限阶段构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d30a215bc9db4b5d\" href=\"?note=d30a215bc9db4b5d\" title=\"43-df-variable\">43-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"809479f98d99c157\" href=\"?note=809479f98d99c157\" title=\"43-df-first-order-language\">43-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\">\\(f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\">\\(\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\)</span> 为有限元组。变量和非逻辑符号的标签采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d30a215bc9db4b5d\" href=\"?note=d30a215bc9db4b5d\" title=\"43-df-variable\">43-df-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"809479f98d99c157\" href=\"?note=809479f98d99c157\" title=\"43-df-first-order-language\">43-df-first-order-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\">\\(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\)</span> 是下式定义的语法对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,\\bar t):=(4,(f,\\bar t)),\\qquad f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):=\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,\\bar t):=(4,(f,\\bar t)),\\qquad f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):=\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{L,0}:=\\operatorname{Var}\\cup L_{\\rm Const}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{L,0}:=\\operatorname{Var}\\cup L_{\\rm Const}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{L,m+1}:=T_{L,m}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\{\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,\\bar t):f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\land\\bar t\\in T_{L,m}^n\\}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{L,m+1}:=T_{L,m}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\{\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,\\bar t):f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\land\\bar t\\in T_{L,m}^n\\}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Term}_L:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}T_{L,m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Term}_L:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}T_{L,m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项是显式有序对编码。标签4与叶子标签0、1不交，函数符号和子项元组可唯一恢复；阶段索引含语言参数，跨语言使用不混淆。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"d30a215bc9db4b5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"809479f98d99c157","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"d30a215bc9db4b5d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$；$f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)$ 为有限元组。变量和非逻辑符号的标签采用 [[43-df-variable]]、[[43-df-first-order-language]]。$f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)$ 是下式定义的语法对象。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"809479f98d99c157","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$；$f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)$ 为有限元组。变量和非逻辑符号的标签采用 [[43-df-variable]]、[[43-df-first-order-language]]。$f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)$ 是下式定义的语法对象。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)","display":false},{"tex":"f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,\\bar t):=(4,(f,\\bar t)),\\qquad f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):=\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{L,0}:=\\operatorname{Var}\\cup L_{\\rm Const}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_{L,m+1}:=T_{L,m}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\{\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,\\bar t):f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\land\\bar t\\in T_{L,m}^n\\}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Term}_L:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}T_{L,m}.","display":true}],"bytes":1656,"backlinks":[{"id":"f36fa03fda24ed88","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$，$t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L$；$R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n$。项和语言签名采用 [[43-df-term]]、[[43-df-first-order-language]]。$t=u$ 作为公式参数时表示下式 $\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)$；元语言等号仍表示集合相等。"},{"id":"16154750d33f58cc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$，$x\\in\\operatorname{Var}$、$c\\in L_{\\rm Const}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$、$f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}$、$R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}$；$t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L$。构造函数采用 [[43-df-term]]、[[43-df-atomic-formula]]、[[43-df-formula]]；以下沿有限语法树递归。"},{"id":"3238d7fca6c27a3f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-497","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-term]] — 项的有限阶段构造"}],"outgoing":["d30a215bc9db4b5d","809479f98d99c157"]}